   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to establish the general aviation task force to study measures that may\nbe implemented to improve general aviation operations in the state of New York",
    "basePrintNo": "S1132",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1132-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Commissions",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S1132\n\nSPONSOR: LIU\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to establish the general aviation task force to study measures\nthat may be implemented to improve general aviation operations in the\nstate of New York\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nEstablishes the general aviation task force to study measures that may\nbe implemented to improve general aviation operations in the state of\nNew York.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 establishes the general aviation task force to conduct a study\non measures that may improve general aviation in the state of New York.\n\nSection 2 lists who the commission shall be made up of and how they\nshall be compensated Section 3 establishes how the task force shall\nreport its findings. Section 4 states that the act shall take effect\nimmediately.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nIt is very important to improve the economy of New York State and to\nimprove tourism across our state, especially for the North Country and\nupstate economies. We must look for ways to increase travel and commer-\ncial exchange between the different regions in New York.  General\naviation aircraft activities allow for accessibility to the less-trav-\neled areas throughout our state. More people can, more easily, explore\nthe treasures throughout New York creating new economic opportunities.\nThis bill would create a taskforce to study how to bolster and improve\nNew York State's environment for general aviation to improve intrastate\ntourism.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nTo be determined\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nEffective immediately\n",
